OL,4,CDenmark accuses Russia of plotting to  
OL,5,Cassassinate US-Ukrainian rapper        
OL,6,GDenmark has accused Russian            
OL,7,Gintelligence services of plotting to   
OL,8,Gassassinate a Ukrainian-American near  
OL,9,GCopenhagen, saying they had "planned"  
OL,10,Gand "initiated" the attempt.           
OL,12,FDenmark's security and intelligence    
OL,13,Fagency (PET) said it had stopped       
OL,14,Findividuals who were intending to kill 
OL,15,Fthe person, named by Danish media as   
OL,16,Frapper Kyivstoner, at a concert in     
OL,17,FSeptember. Two people were charged     
OL,18,Fwith attempted murder and assisting a  
OL,19,Fforeign intelligence service, and      
OL,20,Fpleaded not guilty.                    
